config MTK_VCODEC_MT6735
	tristate "MediaTek MT6735 video codec hardware service"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on COMMON_CLK
	depends on PM
	help
	  Shared power, clock, interrupt and hardware-ownership services for
	  the MediaTek MT6735 VENC (encoder) and VDEC (decoder) video codec
	  engines.  Ported from the Samsung/MediaTek downstream
	  drivers/misc/mediatek/videocodec driver.

	  The codec register sequences themselves are executed by the vendor
	  userspace codec libraries through the register windows exported by
	  this driver; no codec firmware runs in the kernel.
